OL,3,A'We have our own fair playing field':
OL,4,A1Xtra launches first ever UK rap chart
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish rap artists will step into the
OL,7,Fspotlight later when BBC Radio 1Xtra
OL,8,Flaunches the first ever dedicated rap
OL,9,Fchart based on UK listening figures.
OL,11,FDJ Kenny Allstar, who'll host the
OL,12,Fcountdown on Friday nights, has one
OL,13,Fword: "Finally".
OL,15,F"If we have our own fair playing field
OL,16,Fwhere we can all be celebrated... it
OL,17,Fthen feels fair and it feels exciting,"
OL,18,Fhe tells BBC Newsbeat.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
