OL,3,A'We have our own fair playing field':
OL,4,A1Xtra launches first ever UK rap chart
OL,5,
OL,6,FCurrently artists compete across genres
OL,7,Ffor a spot in the Official Singles
OL,8,FChart, but Allstar says this is
OL,9,Fdominated by pop music, making it
OL,10,Fharder for other genres to be heard.
